{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2016-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1473984000, "end_date": 1474588799, "month_true_total": 575, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:05:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "25643025", "author": {"steamid": "76561198285059694", "personaname": "Zackary", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Znalmaleh/", "num_games_owned": 168, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 36520, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 813, "last_played": 1705665099, "avatar": "ba9304dc599bc0e3b406fa153edddc43489dec30"}, "language": "english", "review": "it is so hard to find exile zombies \n", "timestamp_created": 1474588498, "timestamp_updated": 1474588498, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.479452043771743774", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25642896", "author": {"steamid": "76561198324766054", "personaname": "KelSquad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198324766054/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2404, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 238, "last_played": 1558786338, "avatar": "c8bfb454084a645f2380321d2cd5ca8e37df368a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I liked the realism and the freedom.  It feels like I'm in actual battles and the combat feels real.  There is, also, a lot of things to do in Arma 3, lots of weapons and vehicles.  Even your character can do a lot of things, you can go into different positions like prone and others, third and first person or just look over your shoulder, different ways to use one weapon.  One of my biggest complaint is, not clunky controls, just too many controls. For example there are 3 different ways to click right mouse  and one includes clicking one of the keys, all of which are different ways to look in your scope.  But this is forgiveable considering all the things you can do in Arma.  But probably the worst complaint I have is the learning curve.  Due to this game being a kind of simulator, there is a lot of military lingo and such.  In tutorial, there is entire part where it teaches you how to read a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ map.  This is also forgiveable because of the realism.  In conclusion, be a quick learner and not for the faint of heart.", "timestamp_created": 1474587467, "timestamp_updated": 1474587467, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25641763", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255189482", "personaname": "IsolatedGunner", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198255189482/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 347, "last_played": 1678369712, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "ok", "timestamp_created": 1474580625, "timestamp_updated": 1474580625, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.486440688371658325", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "25641591", "author": {"steamid": "76561198214689901", "personaname": "RADYN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RADYN94/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playti